* text=auto

# The vendored library is checked out byte-for-byte, on every platform.
#
# third_party/qrcodegen/README.md publishes the md5 of these two files as the
# proof that they are upstream's. Line-ending normalisation would make that
# claim false on a Windows clone while leaving the content correct, which is the
# worst of both -- a checksum that fails for a reason nobody can see.
third_party/qrcodegen/qrcodegen.c -text
third_party/qrcodegen/qrcodegen.h -text
third_party/qrcodegen/LICENSE     -text

*.png binary
